    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d554">

                <pb facs="0679" n="571" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg571"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr. Snowden.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-02-14"><hi rendition="#italic">February 14,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Snowden is informed that the United States rely on the sense of justice of
                    Spain to meet our just expectations. The assurances given by Spain in 1886 make
                    arbitration as unnecessary as it is unacceptable.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Foster.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
